type: software
title: "A-share Company Intelligence"
abstract: "A provenance-preserving research data system for companies listed on the Shanghai and Shenzhen stock exchanges: collection from statutory disclosures, calibrated extraction, staged validation, point-in-time panels and licence-aware, optionally pseudonymised dataset releases."
